OL,3,GNEWSAPeople deserve to 'feel safe'
OL,4,Aafter crash and fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a town where a car
OL,7,Fcrash and a house fire have left nine
OL,8,Fpeople dead deserve to "feel safe in
OL,9,Ftheir own homes", the local council
OL,10,Fleader has said.
OL,12,FAlec Brown's comments came in response
OL,13,Fto the deaths of seven people,
OL,14,Fincluding two police officers, in the
OL,15,Fcrash at South Bank near Middlesbrough
OL,16,Fon Saturday, followed by a house fire
OL,17,Fin Grangetown on Wednesday that claimed
OL,18,Fthe lives of a woman aged 34 and a
OL,19,Fseven-year-old girl.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
